    a text called 'clock decl' is "a text called ht{n} is \"{{hq{n}'s hour:02}}\"".
    a text called 'clock buffer' is "a buffer called hc{n} is \"{{ht{n}}}\"".
    a text called 'clock check' is "If hc{n}'s length is equal to 2 then, Print \"ht{n} ok\". Otherwise, Print \"ht{n} BAD\"".
    a list called 'the lines' is ['number decl', 'float decl', 'text decl', 'buffer decl', 'buffer fill', 'boolean decl', 'list decl', 'map decl', 'value decl'].
    If 'a thing is available' then,
